// Role enum widened from the original {owner, admin, member, viewer} to match
// the full role matrix required by docs/08-security/SECURITY.md. `member` is
// kept (mapped to the old default) for backward compatibility with any
// pre-existing rows/tests; new code should use `analyst` or `editor` instead
// of the generic `member`. `system` and `super_admin` are never assigned via
// a membership row — `system` is the implicit role background jobs/agents
// run as (never stored), and `super_admin` is a platform-staff flag checked
// against a separate allowlist, not a per-org membership. See DECISIONS.md.
enum role {
